{
  "ep": 34,
  "title": "反向火攻，東吳夢碎",
  "shots": [
    {
      "id": "s01",
      "location": "wu_ship",
      "characters": [
        "sun_quan"
      ],
      "camera": "close-up",
      "motion": "zoom_in",
      "visual": "極近特寫，火光映照在角色臉上，表情從興奮瞬間轉為極度恐懼，瞳孔地震，眼神慌乱地看向後方。",
      "lines": [
        {
          "speaker": "sun_quan",
          "text": "這不可能！火燒我船？",
          "emo": "afraid"
        }
      ],
      "key": true
    },
    {
      "id": "s02",
      "location": "yiling_battlefield",
      "characters": [
        "liu_bei"
      ],
      "camera": "medium",
      "motion": "static",
      "visual": "中景，角色冷靜站立，手持火鉤，背景是熊熊燃燒的江面和翻滾的吳軍戰船，姿態從容不迫。",
      "lines": [],
      "key": false
    },
    {
      "id": "s03",
      "location": "wu_ship",
      "characters": [
        "sun_quan"
      ],
      "camera": "wide",
      "motion": "pan_right",
      "visual": "遠景，旗艦嚴重受損，煙霧瀰漫，角色瀕臨崩潰，周圍將士倉皇逃竄，船體傾斜。",
      "lines": [],
      "key": false
    },
    {
      "id": "s04",
      "location": "yiling_battlefield",
      "characters": [
        "liu_bei"
      ],
      "camera": "close-up",
      "motion": "zoom_in",
      "visual": "特寫，角色眉頭微蹙，眼神冰冷銳利，嘴角勾起一抹不屑的冷笑，火光在眼中跳動。",
      "lines": [
        {
          "speaker": "liu_bei",
          "text": "燒錯了對象。",
          "emo": "disdain"
        }
      ],
      "key": true
    },
    {
      "id": "s05",
      "location": "wu_ship",
      "characters": [
        "sun_quan"
      ],
      "camera": "over-shoulder",
      "motion": "static",
      "visual": "過肩鏡頭，從角色肩後拍攝前方爆炸的火光，角色身體顫抖，顯得渺小無助。",
      "lines": [],
      "key": false
    },
    {
      "id": "s06",
      "location": "yiling_battlefield",
      "characters": [
        "zhuge_liang"
      ],
      "camera": "medium",
      "motion": "pan_left",
      "visual": "中景，角色手持羽扇，面露震驚之色，看著遠處的火海，嘴巴微張，顯然沒料到發展如此迅速。",
      "lines": [
        {
          "speaker": "zhuge_liang",
          "text": "主公，這計策...太狠了。",
          "emo": "surprised"
        }
      ],
      "key": false
    },
    {
      "id": "s07",
      "location": "yiling_battlefield",
      "characters": [
        "liu_bei"
      ],
      "camera": "close-up",
      "motion": "static",
      "visual": "特寫，角色眼神堅定，充滿掌控全局的自信，光影對比強烈，突出其冷血與果斷。",
      "lines": [
        {
          "speaker": "liu_bei",
          "text": "狠，才能活。",
          "emo": "calm"
        }
      ],
      "key": true
    },
    {
      "id": "s08",
      "location": "wu_ship",
      "characters": [
        "sun_quan"
      ],
      "camera": "wide",
      "motion": "zoom_out",
      "visual": "遠景，角色被將士保護著向小艇撤退，旗艦在身後徹底被火海吞噬，絕望感蔓延。",
      "lines": [],
      "key": false
    },
    {
      "id": "s09",
      "location": "yiling_battlefield",
      "characters": [
        "liu_bei"
      ],
      "camera": "medium",
      "motion": "pan_right",
      "visual": "中景，角色轉身面向追擊的吳軍殘部，揮手下令，氣勢壓場。",
      "lines": [],
      "key": false
    },
    {
      "id": "s10",
      "location": "wu_ship",
      "characters": [
        "sun_quan"
      ],
      "camera": "close-up",
      "motion": "zoom_in",
      "visual": "特寫，角色冷汗直流，臉色蒼白，眼神中充滿對劉備的恐懼與不甘。",
      "lines": [
        {
          "speaker": "sun_quan",
          "text": "劉備！你陰我！",
          "emo": "angry"
        }
      ],
      "key": true
    },
    {
      "id": "s11",
      "location": "yiling_battlefield",
      "characters": [
        "liu_bei"
      ],
      "camera": "over-shoulder",
      "motion": "static",
      "visual": "過肩鏡頭，從角色側後方拍攝，前景虛化角色臉龐，背景清晰顯示孫權的小艇在火海中驚慌失措。",
      "lines": [],
      "key": false
    },
    {
      "id": "s12",
      "location": "wu_ship",
      "characters": [
        "sun_quan"
      ],
      "camera": "medium",
      "motion": "zoom_in",
      "visual": "中景，角色跪在小艇上，膝蓋抵住甲板，表情扭曲，完全失去了作為君主的威嚴。",
      "lines": [],
      "key": false
    },
    {
